{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"demon_brute","model_identifier":"demon_brute","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# demon_brute\n\nDemon brute (C2), breaker, 3 m = 107 u to the top of the hump and horns, about 96 u across the iron-bound fists.\n\nA hunched mountain of a red demon, nearly as broad as it is tall: cracked brick-red skin with glowing orange cracks across the chest (glow_crack_chest_*), huge black ram horns curling down round a head sunk between the shoulders, a fanged underbite, burning yellow eyes, fists bound in black iron bands and caps with iron forearm cuffs, and a heavy chain round the waist over a leather loincloth. Baseline humanoid skeleton and slot names (scaled) plus `jaw`.\n\n- Cubes: 48 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 256x256, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -48.5..48.5, y 0.0..105.0, z -21.5..15.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 80 x 104 x 40 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = -2, from y = 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 3.6 | loop |  |\n| `walk` | 1.6 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 1 | loop |  |\n| `charge` | 0.85 | loop | loop, head and horns lowered; the game decides the impact (knockback) when it reaches the target |\n| `attack_smash` | 1.9 | once | key 1.0 s: both fists smash down in front (also its wall attack) |\n| `aggro` | 2 | once | rears up, roars and beats its chest |\n| `injured` | 0.7 | once | heavy flinch |\n| `death` | 2 | hold | topples forward; holds; rests on y = 0 |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 39.1 u/s (1.10 m/s), cycle 1.6 s, 62.6 u per cycle (heavy)\n- `run`: 99.6 u/s (2.80 m/s), cycle 1.0 s, 99.6 u per cycle\n- `charge`: 177.8 u/s (5.00 m/s), cycle 0.85 s, 151.1 u per cycle (head-down charge loop)\n\n## Key times\n\n- `attack_smash`: key 1.0 s: both fists smash down in front (also its wall attack)\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 105, -12)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 71, 16.5)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (12.5, 79.5, 16.5)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (21.5, 89.5, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 67, -16.5)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (38, 29.5, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-47.5, 51, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-38, 29.5, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (19, 47, 10.5)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-19, 47, 10.5)\n\n## Notes\n\n- glow_eye_r / glow_eye_l and glow_crack_chest_* are the lit cubes.\n"},"description":"# demon_brute\n\nDemon brute (C2), breaker, 3 m = 107 u to the top of the hump and horns, about 96 u across the iron-bound fists.\n\nA hunched mountain of a red demon, nearly as broad as it is tall: cracked brick-red skin with glowing orange cracks across the chest (glow_crack_chest_*), huge black ram horns curling down round a head sunk between the shoulders, a fanged underbite, burning yellow eyes, fists bound in black iron bands and caps with iron forearm cuffs, and a heavy chain round the waist over a leather loincloth. Baseline humanoid skeleton and slot names (scaled) plus `jaw`.\n\n- Cubes: 48 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 256x256, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -48.5..48.5, y 0.0..105.0, z -21.5..15.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 80 x 104 x 40 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = -2, from y = 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 3.6 | loop |  |\n| `walk` | 1.6 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 1 | loop |  |\n| `charge` | 0.85 | loop | loop, head and horns lowered; the game decides the impact (knockback) when it reaches the target |\n| `attack_smash` | 1.9 | once | key 1.0 s: both fists smash down in front (also its wall attack) |\n| `aggro` | 2 | once | rears up, roars and beats its chest |\n| `injured` | 0.7 | once | heavy flinch |\n| `death` | 2 | hold | topples forward; holds; rests on y = 0 |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 39.1 u/s (1.10 m/s), cycle 1.6 s, 62.6 u per cycle (heavy)\n- `run`: 99.6 u/s (2.80 m/s), cycle 1.0 s, 99.6 u per cycle\n- `charge`: 177.8 u/s (5.00 m/s), cycle 0.85 s, 151.1 u per cycle (head-down charge loop)\n\n## Key times\n\n- `attack_smash`: key 1.0 s: both fists smash down in front (also its wall attack)\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 105, -12)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 71, 16.5)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (12.5, 79.5, 16.5)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (21.5, 89.5, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 67, -16.5)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (38, 29.5, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-47.5, 51, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-38, 29.5, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (19, 47, 10.5)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-19, 47, 10.5)\n\n## Notes\n\n- glow_eye_r / glow_eye_l and glow_crack_chest_* are the lit cubes.\n","resolution":{"width":256,"height":256},"elements":[{"name":"pelvis","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-18.0,44.0,-11.0],"to":[18.0,52.0,11.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,44.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[188,185,224.0,193.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[36,198,58.0,206.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[0,198,36.0,206.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[58,198,80.0,206.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[72,66,108.0,88.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[108,66,144.0,88.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"18ee114f-e2bc-5540-bd32-852a20d4adb2"},{"name":"chest","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-30.0,52.0,-15.0],"to":[30.0,88.0,15.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,52.0,0.0]